## Streaming & Chat

### 03 · Streaming Text

A composition: `TxStreamMarkdown` word reveal + `TxInlineCitation` inline references + `TxSources` stacked favicons + `TxSuggestionChips` vertical follow-ups. See the [InlineCitation doc](/docs/dev/components/inline-citation).

:::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="AiSuiteStreamingAnswerDemo" code-lang="vue" title="Full streamed answer" description="Inline citations · source stack · follow-up list"}
---
